I just feel like so much of
what we're having to tackle

00:31:39.930 --> 00:31:42.580
professionally in this new environment,

00:31:42.580 --> 00:31:45.460
every time I turn around,
there's a frustration,

00:31:45.460 --> 00:31:50.460
and it, and my patience
has been wearing so thin,

00:31:50.530 --> 00:31:52.870
and then I judge myself,

00:31:52.870 --> 00:31:56.870
and I get down on myself

00:31:56.870 --> 00:31:59.690
because I'm not relaxing enough.

00:31:59.690 --> 00:32:01.860
You're just at home, you know.

00:32:01.860 --> 00:32:05.130
You're able to spend hours with yourself

